{"unit_id":"zdj-1212__dsh-plugin-learning-mode#card-zh","repo":"zdj-1212/dsh-plugin-learning-mode","commit":"07705ed101b30f2b040f5c034062127dfd98c73f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-learning-mode（DSH 插件，Web 与 Desktop 客户端）：把 DSH 会话变成围绕指定主题持续辅导的学习模式。它注册 /learn 命令、注入学习系统提示，并用会话投影保存当前主题和开关状态。用户输入主题后，插件提交请求，让模型先询问学习基础、可投入时间、目标期限、偏好、已有资源和当前难点，再生成个性化资料与分阶段路线；模式开启时，后续回答遵循循序讲解并给出下一步的规则。适合希望在 DSH 中制定并持续推进学习计划的人。插件本身不要求额外 API Key；效果依赖宿主提供的模型与相关命令、会话服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:187-342"]}
{"unit_id":"zdj-1212__dsh-plugin-learning-mode#card-en","repo":"zdj-1212/dsh-plugin-learning-mode","commit":"07705ed101b30f2b040f5c034062127dfd98c73f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-learning-mode (DSH Web/Desktop) adds /learn, a persistent study mode. It saves a topic in session state, asks about the learner’s background and goals, then requests tailored materials and a staged roadmap. No separate API key is configured.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:187-342"]}
